ion. I'm running a survey about the demo. Feel free to sen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:45:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686063","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5110300-1846018067931932","game_id":"steam-5110300","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes","summary":"Bug Fixes Bug Fixes ・Fixed an issue where the tester-only scenario could be viewed ・Fixed a missing portion of Tozasu Kannuki's character portrait ・Fixed an issue where volume could not be adjusted during puzzle scenes ・Fixed a bug related to the launch configuration Known Issues ・Some text/UI elements overflow their display area ・Some graphics flicker in certain places The known issues may take a little time to fix. We've received so much feedback since the demo was released, and we're truly gr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T02:02:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5110300-1846018067924677","game_id":"steam-5110300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"The Demo Is Now Available! We have some great news for everyone reading this announcement: the demo for Recycle Shop ECO is now live! In the demo, you can play through a large portion of the puzzle gameplay, the first episode of each character's story, and some of the casual conversations. Please Take Our Content Survey We're also collecting feedback on the demo through a short survey. It includes questions about the game genres you enjoy, along with a few casual questions about which characters","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T00:53:52Z",